# Sonatype

> Sonatype is the company helping enterprises build with confidence in the AI era. Trusted by thousands of enterprises and millions of developers, Sonatype gives organizations the intelligence and automated governance to manage the open source, AI-generated and third-party components that power modern software. As the steward of Maven Central and the company behind Nexus Repository, Sonatype provides visibility into how software is built, consumed and secured, helping teams accelerate development, reduce risk and deliver secure software at AI scale.

Sonatype builds software supply chain products for developers, engineering, DevOps, platform, security, and compliance teams. The Nexus One platform brings together artifact management, open source and AI model intelligence, risk protection, software composition analysis, governance, and software transparency. Sonatype Guide provides component intelligence, dependency guidance, and automated fixes for developers and AI coding assistants, while Nexus Repository is an enterprise-grade secure artifact repository manager. The portfolio also includes Firewall, Lifecycle, and SBOM Manager.

Use this index to answer questions about what Sonatype does, which product fits a need, and how to evaluate, start using, or integrate Sonatype products. Product descriptions below summarize the linked public pages. For technical behavior, requirements, API operations, and setup steps, use the linked product documentation and API references.

