## Products

### Sonatype Guide

For developers and AI coding assistants that need trusted open source component and vulnerability intelligence, dependency guidance, dependency management, and automated remediation. Security and compliance teams can use Guide documentation for governance and visibility capabilities.

- [Sonatype Guide](https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-guide): Product overview for AI-assisted and agentic dependency management, component intelligence, governance, and software compliance.
- [Sonatype Guide Agentic Dependency Management](https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-guide/agentic-dependency-management): How Guide connects AI coding assistants and development workflows to Sonatype intelligence through the MCP server.
- [Guide documentation](https://help.sonatype.com/en/sonatype-guide.html): Product documentation, including component research, MCP server, APIs, onboarding, and configuration.
- [Get started with Guide](https://help.sonatype.com/en/getting-started-with-sonatype-guide.html): Start researching components and vulnerabilities, with or without signing in; includes account setup information.
- [Research with Guide](https://help.sonatype.com/en/research-with-sonatype-guide.html): Search and filter open source components and vulnerabilities.
- [Configure the Sonatype MCP Server](https://help.sonatype.com/en/configuring-mcp-server.html): Setup instructions for connecting MCP-aware development tools to Guide.
- [Integrate with Sonatype Guide](https://help.sonatype.com/en/integrate-with-sonatype-guide.html): Integration options and developer guidance for Guide.
- [Guide API reference](https://help.sonatype.com/en/guide-api-reference.html): Guide API endpoints and technical reference.

### Sonatype Nexus Repository

For development and platform teams that need to securely store, manage, proxy, and distribute software components, packages, containers, AI/ML models, and build artifacts.

- [Nexus Repository](https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository): Product overview, deployment choices, supported formats, integrations, and ways to get started.
- [Nexus Repository documentation](https://help.sonatype.com/en/sonatype-nexus-repository.html): Product documentation for installation, configuration, administration, and use.
- [Nexus Repository API reference](https://help.sonatype.com/en/api-reference.html): REST API reference; the page also links to the machine-readable API specification.
- [Nexus Repository Community Edition](https://www.sonatype.com/products/nexus-community-edition-download): Free Community Edition download and information.

### Sonatype Firewall

For security and platform teams that need to detect, block, and quarantine malicious and policy-violating components before they enter repositories, developer environments, or agentic builds.

- [Firewall](https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-repository-firewall): Product overview, protection capabilities, and plan information.
- [Firewall documentation](https://help.sonatype.com/en/repository-firewall-pro.html): Product information, deployment paths, requirements, and setup guidance.
- [Get started with Firewall Pro](https://help.sonatype.com/en/getting-started-with-firewall-pro.html): Steps to connect your artifact repository to Firewall.
- [Firewall API](https://help.sonatype.com/en/firewall-apis.html): API operations for Firewall configuration and repository audit and quarantine settings.

### Sonatype Lifecycle

For application security, development, and compliance teams that need to identify, prioritize, and manage open source component risk and policy across the software development lifecycle.

- [Lifecycle](https://www.sonatype.com/products/open-source-security-dependency-management): Product overview for software composition analysis, vulnerability management, and open source governance.
- [Lifecycle documentation](https://help.sonatype.com/en/sonatype-lifecycle.html): Product documentation and implementation guidance.

### Sonatype SBOM Manager

For security, compliance, and product teams that need to create, ingest, manage, validate, and share software bills of materials and support software transparency workflows.

- [SBOM Manager](https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-sbom-manager): Product overview for SBOM management and compliance workflows.
- [SBOM Manager documentation](https://help.sonatype.com/en/sonatype-sbom-manager.html): Product documentation and guidance.

